  * `{0,0}` or `{0}`: they match the expression zero times. The same behavior can be achieved by removing the expression. 



Noncompliant Code Example
    
    
    "ab{1,1}c"
    "ab{1}c"
    "ab{0,0}c"
    "ab{0}c"
    

Compliant Solution
    
    
    "abc"
    "ac"
    

